    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Once upon a time, there was a legend about this place.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 2D frame-by-frame hand-drawn animations, carefully selected soundtrack, 2D action game combining exploration, action and adventure elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373760/extras/11.png?t=1734361333\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you have the courage to go through with it?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for hidden secrets in the depths of the Sky City and defeat powerful enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect ancient scrolls until the end ....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373760/extras/918e9ba3ce42c1cf938543dbb6d449bd.avif?t=1734361333\" width=600 height=515 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the best-kept secrets of the monster world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level, the difficulty increases. New monsters are appearing all the time, and the only thing you can rely on is yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373760/extras/63a9f293adef6282b33df3b50a9cc6a8.avif?t=1734361333\" width=600 height=460 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Frame-by-frame hand-drawn animation, taking you to experience a different 2D world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike the commonly used Spine animation in games, we use a frame-by-frame hand-drawn animation, which makes the monster's movements more flexible and vivid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373760/extras/dd1a46e7a067ecc90e6eca9e927c3116.avif?t=1734361333\" width=600 height=393 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Once upon a time, there was a legend about this place.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 2D frame-by-frame hand-drawn animations, carefully selected soundtrack, 2D action game combining exploration, action and adventure elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373760/extras/11.png?t=1734361333\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you have the courage to go through with it?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for hidden secrets in the depths of the Sky City and defeat powerful enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect ancient scrolls until the end ....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373760/extras/918e9ba3ce42c1cf938543dbb6d449bd.avif?t=1734361333\" width=600 height=515 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the best-kept secrets of the monster world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level, the difficulty increases. New monsters are appearing all the time, and the only thing you can rely on is yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373760/extras/63a9f293adef6282b33df3b50a9cc6a8.avif?t=1734361333\" width=600 height=460 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Frame-by-frame hand-drawn animation, taking you to experience a different 2D world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike the commonly used Spine animation in games, we use a frame-by-frame hand-drawn animation, which makes the monster's movements more flexible and vivid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373760/extras/dd1a46e7a067ecc90e6eca9e927c3116.avif?t=1734361333\" width=600 height=393 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "AFei's Trouble is a 2D side-scrolling action platformer where you'll have to beat levels and challenge your final enemies, full of monsters and giant bosses waiting to be challenged to slash you out. Fight your way until you reach the final boss and dodge its kill, and see how long you can survive.",
